<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Tongkah suspension extended.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Tongkah suspension extended.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange said it has allowed Tongkah Holdings Bhd to suspend its stock for a further five trading days pending the completion of talks to acquire stakes in a hospital and a finance company.  </p>
<p>The Exchange said the extended suspension would commence on November 20 and end on November 26.</p>
<p>Tongkah had announced the acquisition of a 16.45 percent stake in Hospital Pantai Bhd and an 88 percent stake in Perdana Finance Bhd earlier in November.</p>
<p>Tongkah stock has been suspended since October 28, when it closed at 23.82.</p>
<p>The comapny's businesses include a brokerage firm, an Internet service provider, hospitals and a seismic data processing company.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
